\f0\fs24\b Nissan Leaf\b0\par
Nissan Leaf is one of the early mass-produced electric vehicles.\par
Because of that, it is often used as an example when explaining modern electric mobility.\par
It is suitable for city and suburban driving and it is simple to use.\par
Main advantages: quiet driving, easy controls and practical everyday use.\par
